<title>HONG KONG: TST Prop places 238 mln Sino Land shares.</title>
<headline>TST Prop places 238 mln Sino Land shares.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tsim Sha Tsui Properties Ltd has placed out 238 million shares of Sino Land Co Ltd at HK$9.13 per share, an official at arranger Peregrine Brokerage said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Tsim Sha Tsui Properties will at the same time subscribe for the same amount of new shares at a similar price, the official said.</p>
<p>The share issue is expected to raise about HK$2.17 billion, which will be used by Sino Land to finance the land premium of the airport railway's Tai Kok Tsui station development project, the official said.</p>
<p>The companies officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
